    'transit'=> '<p>The <strong>MBTA Red Line</strong> runs through Cambridge with stops at Kendall/MIT, Central, Harvard, Porter and Alewife, connecting to downtown Boston in minutes. The <strong>Green Line</strong> reaches Lechmere in East Cambridge, MBTA buses fill the gaps, and Porter Square has commuter rail service.</p><p><strong>Boston Logan International Airport (BOS)</strong> is reachable by subway with a transfer. Cambridge is very bikeable, with Bluebikes bike share, and most residents live without a car.</p>',
    'tips' => [
