      'nurses'   => 'Travel nurses can work at <strong>Mount Auburn Hospital</strong> or <strong>Cambridge Health Alliance</strong> in Cambridge, or commute to Boston hospitals such as <strong>Massachusetts General Hospital</strong> and the Longwood Medical Area. The Red Line makes Mass General an easy ride from Kendall or Central.',
