    'transit'=> '<p><strong>Gainesville RTS</strong> (Regional Transit System) runs buses throughout the city with dense service around UF, where students ride with their ID. Campus and Midtown are walkable and bikeable, though summer heat is intense.</p><p><strong>Gainesville Regional Airport (GNV)</strong> has limited flights; Jacksonville and Orlando airports are about two hours away by car. Beyond campus, Gainesville is spread out and most residents drive.</p>',
