    'transit'=> '<p><strong>Lane Transit District (LTD)</strong> runs buses across Eugene and Springfield, including the <strong>EmX</strong> bus rapid transit line. Eugene is very bike-friendly, with river paths and bike lanes throughout.</p><p><strong>Eugene Airport (EUG)</strong> is northwest of town, and Amtrak Cascades and Coast Starlight trains stop downtown. Plenty of people near campus get by on a bike alone.</p>',
