    'transit'=> '<p><strong>Caltrain</strong> stops at Palo Alto and California Avenue stations, connecting to San Francisco and San Jose. <strong>VTA</strong> and <strong>SamTrans</strong> buses serve the area, and Stanford&rsquo;s free <strong>Marguerite</strong> shuttle connects campus to the Palo Alto station and nearby areas.</p><p><strong>San Jose (SJC)</strong> and <strong>San Francisco (SFO)</strong> airports are both within reach by car or transit. Palo Alto is flat and very bikeable, though many residents still use a car for regional trips.</p>',
