    'transit'=> '<p><strong>StarMetro</strong> runs city buses, with routes serving FSU, FAMU and downtown. Campus areas and Midtown are walkable, but most of the city is car-dependent.</p><p><strong>Tallahassee International Airport (TLH)</strong> is southwest of downtown. Plan on driving for most errands.</p>',
